      "content": "support groups... they're just more of the same. more bureaucracy, more people telling me to \"stay positive\" while the floor is literally being pulled out from under me. it doesn't feel like a feeling, it feels like a fact. the world has decided i don't belong here, and no amount of \"grace\" is going to change the fact that the paperwork says i'm nothing. it's like trying to argue with a brick wall that's slowly closing in. it's just... it's futile. everything is just futile.",
